10.40.1 Expenditure
The parties agree that the University is best served when staff have the opportunities for personal
development and career advancement and to work in an environment that will encourage them to develop
their abilities and leadership potential.
10.40.2 Counsellors
In order to further the objectives of the University, the activities of each full time Counsellor shall be supported
by $500 in expenditures in each contractual yea","According to the Collective Agreement, the following apply to professional development:

* Full-time Professional Staff are entitled to three (3) professional development days, effective July 1, 2023.
* Requests for professional development days must be made at least seven (7) days in advance, and approval will not be unreasonably withheld.
* Professional Staff will be required to provide a description of the professional development activities being pursued during the designated days.
* If the Employer requests a full-time Professional Staff to enroll in a course/conference outside the University, reimbursement of tuition will be granted at 100% by that department's budget.",llama3.2:3b-instruct-q4_K_M,en,3,True,,,,,2.0797,3.0075,178.3208,4374.0,311.8,,,,bridge
