shall be exercised in a manner consistent with the provisions of this
Collective Agreement. ARTICLE 2.15 – RECOGNITION OF THE BARGAINING UNIT
2.15.1 The Employer recognises the Union as the exclusive
Bargaining Agent for the Bargaining Unit(s) defined in the Ontario Labour Relations Board Certificates of
