previous appointment. A Member so reappointed may, subsequent to reappointment, also apply fo",84cc787e-f01e-4cf3-be89-95e976ed238e,0.0161,0.0137,0.0161,"The Committee's work will include an examination of procedures and physical facilities brought to its attention, as these
