c) The Member shall only be required to submit one medical certificate of disability or illness per absence,
unless the expected duration of the absence is extended beyond the prognosis provided in the original
cert",d8107488-37f5-47f9-8685-6fbeae2b9a34,0.3283,0.2627,0.0161,"18.02 The Parties agree to continue the current practice of participation in the existing plans.
18.03 Short-term Disability
