affect terms and conditions of employment, including, but not limited to, offers of
employment, workload assignment, terms of approved leaves, and discipline, shall be copied
to the Union simultaneously.",d1222f52-ec34-45dd-b727-e9d96aecf332,0.4589,0.4474,0.0161,"ARTICLE 5.40 – ACADEMIC WORKLOAD
5.40.1 The academic workload shall be assigned in a fair and equitable manner. To help ensure this goal, each
