Dean/University Librarian or a person authorised by the Dean/University Librarian. Material in the files which is ",094b0821-9ba5-4906-adb2-6b4f18cb8d5d,0.4269,0.3629,0.0161,"25.07 Notice Required for Parental Leave
a) A Member shall give written notice to the Employer of the Member's intention to take a
parental leave at least four (4) weeks prior to the commencement of such leave. The
notice period may be altered by mutual agreement.
b) The notice period in Article 25.07 a) shall not apply if the Member stops working because
