no later than December of the final year of their first probationary period.
4.40.6 Criteria
a. For renewal and tenure evaluation ctiteria, the APC and ref",d7e1df36-5ea1-4989-b546-c2647779948b,0.4763,0.4049,0.0164,"14.12 Quorum shall consist of the full committee.
