Expenditures for Sessional Members (Counsellors only), Article 5.25 – Employment Equi","According to Article 3.30, the Employer acknowledges its responsibility to maintain facilities, services, and general working conditions that support the effective discharge by Members of their responsibilities.

Additionally, Article 1.24 mentions that all Members, including retirees, upon request, will be supplied with a photo identification card at no cost to them except if they require a replacement for a lost card.

