Employer shall communicate the composition of the selection committee on the RCD Office website. The participation of Faculty Members in the sele","According to the collective agreement, there are two conditions that apply to the Laurentian University Research Fund (LURF):

1. For faculty from federated or affiliated universities wishing to apply for LURF funding, their home institution must have contributed an amount per full-time Member equivalent to what is provided by the Employer.
2. The Employer will provide an additional $20,000 per year to support both research activities and attendance at academic and professional conferences through the Vice-President, Research.

 Source: 6.25.2 For each of the years of the Collective Agreement, the Employer will provide to the Vice-President, Research an additional twenty thousand dollars ($20,000) per year to support both research activities and attendance at academic and professional conferences.

