ACCIDENTAL DEATH AND
DISMEMBERMENT. You will be required to join the life",22664915-0de0-412b-a55b-65c78582f319,0.3922,0.3334,0.0159,"ARTICLE 30 — PROFESSIONAL DEVELOPMENT
30.01 Each full-time Member shall be eligible to receive a professional allowance for each
contractual year, such allowance to be spent for expenses related to approved academic
research or professional purposes. Such an allowance shall be cumulative over two (2)
academic years.","According to Article 30 of the LUFA-H Collective Agreement 2016-2020, there are specific rules regarding professional development for Sessional Members.

For Sessional Members:

* They are eligible for a professional development allowance of $250 per each three credit course taught, up to a limit of $2,000.
* This allowance is used in the current and subsequent academic year (Article 30.07).

It's also worth noting that full-time Members have a different system for receiving professional development allowances:

* They are eligible to receive a professional allowance for each contractual year, which can be spent on expenses related to approved academic research or professional purposes.
* The allowance is cumulative over two academic years.

I hope this clarifies the rules concerning professional development!",llama3.2:3b-instruct-q4_K_M,en,1,True,,,,,2.4947,2.3378,24.0429,4671.0,366.3,,,,bridge
