test_en_203,What are the rules concerning sabbatical leaves?,cca34915-559d-4a63-bd75-228229a52278,0.5013,0.4261,0.0164,"22.07 A sabbatical leave is for a period of twelve (12) months, commencing on 1 July, or for six (6)
