5.20.01 Preamble
a. In recognition of the fact that Members are required to continue to",df4913d4-0e4a-4457-850d-5898735d6a0e,0.0161,0.0101,0.0161,"When Members take a sabbatical leave after three
(3) years all accumulated years of eligibility are exhausted except as otherwise provided for by this
