LUFA-H Collective Agreement 2","According to Article 25 - Family Responsibility Leave for Full-Time Faculty, a pregnant Member shall be entitled to seventeen (17) weeks of Pregnancy Leave. During this period, the Member shall receive from the Employer:

* 100% of her nominal salary for the first two (2) weeks.
* An amount equal to the difference between the Employment Insurance (EI) benefits received by the Member and 100% of the Member's nominal salary for up to a maximum of fifteen (15) additional weeks.

Additionally, if the Member is disentitled or disqualified from receiving EI benefits or should EI cease to provide coverage for pregnancy benefits or adjust the amount of benefits that were received, the Employer shall maintain the Member at 100% of her nominal earnings for the period of her leave unless the Member is disqualified or reduced due to fraud or for engaging in alternate employment.",llama3.2:3b-instruct-q4_K_M,en,3,False,,,,,2.3034,2.9318,225.8023,4671.0,375.8,,,,bridge
