The purpose ofsabbatical leave is to foster the pursuit of knowledge and serve the academic and scholarly objectives",ae4b9a94-96c9-478f-8505-2984477853af,0.4959,0.3471,0.0159,"Members who are on sabbatical leave and who elect to remain on campus for all or part of the duration of the leave shall
not normally be assigned any formal workload nor shall they normally participate in any formal activities of the University
other than those required by this Collective
Agreement. Members who have indicated in their sabbatical plan their intent to spend part or all of their sabbatical leave
on campus are entitled to suitable office space on campus. Sabbaticants required to mov","Sabbatical leaves are addressed in the following ways:

1. Compensation for sabbatical leaves coincides with the Collective Agreement in place, and salary, benefits, and other provisions will be adjusted according to any new agreement between the Board and the Association (LUFA-H Collective Agreement 2016-2020, page 33).
2. The purpose of sabbatical leave is to foster the pursuit of knowledge and serve the academic and scholarly objectives (AR12T— SAIBBCATICALL LEAVE, page ... no specific page number provided in the context).
3. Members who are on sabbatical leave are not normally assigned any formal workload nor participate in any formal activities of the University, except those required by this Collective Agreement (LUFA-H Collective Agreement 2016-2020, page ... no specific page number provided in the context).
4. Members who have indicated their intent to spend part or all of their sabbatical leave on campus are entitled to suitable office space on campus.

Note: The page numbers for clauses 2 and 3 are not specified in the context provided.",llama3.2:3b-instruct-q4_K_M,en,1,True,,,,,2.5837,2.6421,40.0413,4671.0,375.3,,,,bridge
