C","According to the Collective Agreement, professional development is addressed through:

1. Expenditure: The University agrees to support staff personal development and career advancement by providing $500 in expenditures each contractual year (ARTICLE 10.40.1).
2. Professional Development Allowance for Sessional Members: Sessional members are eligible for a professional development allowance of $250 per three credit course, up to a limit of $2,000, to support their teaching and scholarly activities (ARTICLE 30.07).

Additionally, the agreement mentions that professional development is also supported through sabbatical leaves, which allow staff to take a leave of absence to pursue scholarly or pedagogical work (ARTICLE 12.05).",llama3.2:3b-instruct-q4_K_M,en,1,True,,,,,2.7452,3.0346,28.1345,4669.0,371.1,,,,bridge
