10.01 The Members of the bargaining unit, as academics, are committed to the transmission and creative expression of
knowledge, to the clarification and extension of its boundaries, to university governance, and to professional and
community service. They are entitled to and are expected to engage in the following activities, in a reasonable proportion
varying from individual to individual:
(a) the performance of teaching duties as assigned according to this Collec",c260d201-d60a-4c55-a254-869c3b1449fc,0.4291,0.3754,0.0159,"10.03 Scholarly Activity
Each full time member will be entitled to and expected to devote a reasonable amount oftime to research, scholarly,
17 of 66
<<>>
Collective Agreement 2018-2021 and creative activities.
(a) For the purposes ofthis Collective Agreement the term ‘scholarly activity’ means:
(i) research directed towards a contribution to knowledge, and the dissemination ofthe results ofthat research; and/or,
(ii) participation in those academic activities that contribute to the enhancement,","According to the Collective Agreement 2018-2021, academic activity is expected to include:

* The transmission and creative expression of knowledge
* Clarification and extension of its boundaries (Article 10.01)
* University governance
* Professional and community service (Article 10.01)

In terms of specific activities, full-time members are entitled to and expected to devote a reasonable amount of time to research, scholarly, and creative activities, as defined in Article 10.03.

The term ""scholarly activity"" is further specified in Article 10.03(a) as:

* Research directed towards a contribution to knowledge
* Dissemination of the results of that research
* Participation in academic activities that contribute to the enhancement of academic standards and quality (Article 10.03(a)(i) and (ii))

Additionally, academics are entitled to engage in teaching duties as assigned according to this Collective Agreement (Article 10.01).",llama3.2:3b-instruct-q4_K_M,en,1,True,,,,,2.1467,3.0782,36.9309,4669.0,374.7,,,,bridge
