Members and Members who died while in the employ of the University, upon request, will be supplied with a photo
identification library card at no cost to them except if they require a replacement for a lost card. The cards will receive a renewal sticker yearly and be reissued only if necessary. The charge for replacement will be
fifteen dollars ($15) per card.
162 of 243
