NOTE: The following procedures and practices are currently ",d37e9c87-77c9-4346-b13c-a1e39788e6fb,0.3725,0.3166,0.0161,"Hereinafter, this title shall be referred to as the Collective Agreement. ARTICLE 1.15 – OFFICIAL LANGUAGES
