on campus are entitled to suitable office space on campus. Sabbaticants required to mov","According to the LUFA-H Collective Agreement 2016-2020 (page 33), when a member takes a sabbatical leave after three (3) years, all accumulated years of eligibility are exhausted except as otherwise provided for by this Collective Agreement.

