1.15.2 The Parties agree to coope","According to Article 1.30 – DEFINITIONS, the Collective Agreement defines several words with specific meanings:

* Academic Year is defined as the twelve (12) month period commencing July 1 and ending June 30 of any given year.
* Adjunct faculty Members are defined as those persons outside the university whose scholarly or professional accomplishments merit association with the university.
* Adjunct appointments do not have ranks or carry the right to vote in Department/School decision-making.
* Centres are defined as Counselling Services and Indigenous Sharing and Learning Centre.
* Chair/Director is defined as the Chair/Director of any teaching department/professional school/library department.
* Clinic is defined as the Orthophonie Clinic.
* Clinical Sessionals are defined as a Member hitherto a Member of the Bargaining Unit designated by the February 26, 2016 OLRB certificate.
* Clinician is defined as a Member hitherto a Member of the Bargaining Unit designated by the May 6, 2018 OLRB certificate.

These definitions are provided to ensure clarity and consistency in the interpretation of the Collective Agreement.",llama3.2:3b-instruct-q4_K_M,en,3,True,,,,,2.7476,2.7241,192.9828,4669.0,395.6,,,,bridge
