33.01 Chairs/Coordinators are elected to a three-year (3) term by a simple majority of the full-time
Members of a department/program, in a departmental/program meeting chaired by the
President or his/her designate and held no later than March 15 of the year in which the new
Chair/Coordinator is to assume duties. Chairs/Coordinators are responsible for providing
