credits added to their salary for every year they are Chair. Chairs duties begin on July 1.","According to Article 33 of the Laurentian University Faculty Association collective agreement, a Chair/Coordinator is elected by a simple majority of full-time members of a department/program and serves a three-year term. The Chair/Coordinator is responsible for providing academic leadership to their department/program and representing its decisions and objectives.

Additionally, as stated in Article 33.02, Department Chairs receive a 6 credit reduction in teaching or the value equivalent to 6-credits added to their salary for every year they serve as Chair.

