All Members who teach on-campus shall be eligible, on a first-come first-serve basis, for free
parking at the University during the duration of their contract. Members shall receive
reimbursement for parking to a maximum of $4.00 per day (based on the actual and most
economical parking costs) of scheduled teaching at partner institutions excluding the
Laurentian campus.",d876dc30-855e-4370-93db-5bfd73f995c4,0.0164,0.016,0.0164,"The approval of a Plan by the University’s creditors, as well as
