8.70.1 The Parties agree that Members wishing to reserve a parking space in any parking area on campus shall pay the
fee established by the University. The parking fees shall be determined fol","According to the Laurentian University Faculty Association collective agreement, Article 8.70 and Section 32.04 state:

* All Members who teach on-campus are eligible for free parking on a first-come, first-serve basis during their contract (Section 32.04).
* For scheduled teaching at partner institutions excluding the Laurentian campus, members will receive reimbursement up to $4.00 per day for actual and most economical parking costs (Section 32.04).

Additionally, Section 8.70.1 states that members wishing to reserve a parking space on campus must pay the fee established by the University, which is determined according to the university's guidelines.

