received by the Me",9cc7ae4d-e73a-4983-b40e-ccd6e6982623,0.3701,0.3146,0.0159,"Probationary Appointments/Tenure Appointments
5.20.18 Probationary appointments are defined as appointments lasting up to a maximum of five
(5) years, during which time the Employer and the Member are afforded an opportunity for mutual appraisal.
5.20.19 Probation does not imply that the Employer will grant tenure at the end of the probationary period; it does imply
that the Employer will give serious consideration to awarding tenure.
5.20.20 Should a Member holding a term appointment wish to ap","According to Article 5.20.23, if a Member is appointed to the position, it shall be a final probationary appointment of one (1) year with tenure evaluation to begin by September 30 of that year.

However, for Members appointed at the rank of Lecturer/General Librarian and Assistant Professor/Librarian, the initial probationary appointment shall be for a period of three (3) years (Article 5.20.23).

There is no mention of conditions applying to duration in Article 5.20.23 itself. However, it's possible that you are referring to Article 7.60, which outlines parental leave provisions.

If that's the case, there are certain conditions that apply to the duration of parental leave, such as:

* The leave must be commenced within 52 weeks from the date the child comes into care or custody of the parent for the first time (Article 7.60.6).
* During the period of parental leave, a Member shall receive from the Employer: (i) one-hundred percent (100%) of their nominal salary for the first two (2) weeks; and (ii) an amount equal to the difference between the EI benefits received by the Member and one-hundred percent (100%) of their nominal salary for up to a maximum of seven (7) additional weeks.
* The period of parental leave shall be included in the calculation of her/his length of service for seniority purposes (Article 7.60.9).

Please let me know if I'm correct, or if you have any further questions!",llama3.2:3b-instruct-q4_K_M,en,3,False,,,,,2.195,3.1277,194.6451,4669.0,412.2,,,,bridge
