degree credit programme, persons not assigned responsibili",2722ba9a-2f56-4f46-aa50-8d201abbe577,0.4581,0.4009,0.0159,"ARTICLE 10 - ACTIVITES UNIVERSITAIRES
10.01 En tant qu’universitaires, les membres de l’unité de négociation se consacrent à la transmission et à l’expression
créatrice du savoir, à son éclaircissement et à l'élargissement de ses frontières, à l’administration universitaire et au
service à la profession et à la communauté, Ils ont le droit d’exercer les activités suivantes et l’on s’attend à ce qu’ils s’y
engagent, dans des proportions raisonnables, variant selon les personnes :
(a) _ ils effect","According to Article 10 of the Collective Agreement 2008-11 and Article 10 - Activités Universitaires in the 2011-14 Collective Agreement, academics are committed to transmission and creative expression of knowledge, clarification and extension of its boundaries, university governance, and professional and community service.

They are entitled to and expected to engage in the following activities:

(a) performance of teaching duties as assigned according to this Collective Agreement
(b) research, scholarly and creative activities
(c) University service
(d) Professional and community service

These domains of activity carry different implications for the workload of members and may vary according to a member's discipline, from member to member, and from year to year for each member.

Source: Collective Agreement 2008-11, Article 10; Collective Agreement 2011-14, Article 10 - Activités Universitaires.",llama3.2:3b-instruct-q4_K_M,en,3,False,,,,,2.2558,2.3954,207.9458,4669.0,418.4,,,,bridge
