(b) During the period of pregnancy leave as specified in Article 7.60.1 (a) above, the Member shall receive from the
Employer:
(i) For the first week, one-hundred percent (100%) of her nominal salary;
(ii) For up to a maximum of sixteen
(16) additional weeks",896f8061-f2ff-420a-970b-af2cb56517e7,0.4233,0.3598,0.0303,"In the case where the newborn child is hospitalized, a Member may postpone or interrupt her
pregnancy leave by the number of weeks the newborn child is hospitalized but it must be taken within the fifty-two (52)
weeks from the date of the birth of the child.
(b) The pregnancy leave of a Member who is not entitled to take parental leave shall end on the later of either the day that
is seventeen (17) weeks after the pregnancy leave began or the day that is six (6) weeks after the birth, still birt","According to the context provided by the Collective Agreement 2017-2020:

For Pregnancy Leave:
- A pregnant full-time Member or pregnant Master Lecturer Member shall be entitled to 17 weeks of pregnancy leave.
- During this period, the member receives 100% of their nominal salary for the first week and up to 16 additional weeks, with any difference between EI benefits and 100% of their nominal salary being paid by the employer.

For Parental Leave:
- A Member who is a parent and has opted to take parental leave under the Employment Insurance Act and applicable legislation shall be entitled to a parental leave of up to 35 weeks.
- During this period, the member receives:
    - 100% of their nominal salary for the first week
    - Up to 8 additional weeks, with any difference between EI benefits and 100% of their nominal salary being paid by the employer
- In case of any adjustment to the Member's EI benefit entitlement, the Employer shall pay the necessary amount to ensure the Member receives the top-up.

For Adoption Leave:
- On the occasion of the adoption of a child coming into the care or custody of a parent for the first time, a Member who is a parent shall be entitled to a parental leave of up to 37 weeks.",llama3.2:3b-instruct-q4_K_M,en,2,True,,,,,2.685,2.6748,139.8559,4669.0,418.0,,,,bridge
