(ii) failure to comply with any of the provisions of this Agreement, minor technical violations excepted.
(c) The following are the o",b7da3e51-5b16-4cb0-baff-e573d731b5a3,0.3719,0.2325,0.0278,"Disciplinary action shall be just and reasonable and
