5.15.4 Some specific feat","The Collective Agreement 2008-11 does not specifically define or describe a ""teaching department"" as a separate entity. However, it mentions that Sessional Members shall be covered by the general provisions regarding teaching and professional librarianship in clauses 5.15.5 to 5.15.18 of Article 5.15 – Rights, Responsibilities and Duties of Academics, except for specific clauses within this section that clearly apply only to full-time faculty.

In other words, Sessional Members are covered under the teaching provisions, but it's not explicitly stated whether there is a separate ""teaching department"" or not.",llama3.2:3b-instruct-q4_K_M,en,3,True,,,,,2.9239,2.758,231.338,4669.0,419.2,,,,bridge
