établies aux articles 0 à 7, aux articles 11.07 à 11.25, ainsi qu'aux articles 15 et 21 à 26.","Unfortunately, I couldn't find any information on sessional members in the provided text. The sections 5.20 to 5.22 appear to discuss term appointments, probationary appointments, and faculty ranks, but they do not specifically address sessional members.

However, section 11.27 does mention that ""Un nouveau membre à temps partiel est visé seulement par les dispositions de la présente Convention collective établies aux articles 0 à 7, aux articles 11.07 à 11.25, ainsi qu'aux articles 15 et 21 à 26."" This suggests that the Collective Agreement does apply to part-time (sessional) members, but it does not provide specific details about their appointment and renewal processes.

