(a) the performance ofteaching duties as assigned according to this Collectiv",0452e4c2-8d8b-4735-849d-3be22a64e283,0.0161,0.0141,0.0161,"The dossier shall include: an up-to-date curriculum vitae that details the applicant’s scholarly research activity and
