(b) And on such other holidays as declared by the Employer, including the cu",1f807244-7328-4cde-ab66-0ef52bae0b20,0.0161,0.0113,0.0161,"INVALIDITÉ À LONG TERME. Il est obligatoire de cotiser au régime d’indemnité pour invalidité à long terme, qui
