COLLECTIVE
AGREEMENT
BETWEEN
THE LAURENTIAN UNIVERSITY FACULTY ASSOCIATION
AND
THE BOARD OF GOVERNORS OF LAURENTIAN UNIVERSITY
1 JULY 2020 TO 30 JUNE 2025
